     2164   DEFINE VARIABLE ED-notes AS CHARACTER
     2165        VIEW-AS EDITOR SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
     2166        SIZE 98 BY 2.75
     2167        BGCOLOR 8 FGCOLOR 4  NO-UNDO.
