     2221         ink-doc.rest-tpsi COLUMN-LABEL "Ост-ки!ТПСИ" FORMAT "+/":U
     2222       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 97.63 BY 15.42.
     2223   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2224        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2225        B-mark AT ROW 1 COL 11
     2226        B-sel AT ROW 1 COL 21
     2227        B-export AT ROW 1 COL 31
     2228        B-chk AT ROW 1 COL 41
